==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|doughter}}, {{m|enm|doghter}}, from {{inh|en|ang|dohtor|t=daughter}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*dohter}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*duhtēr}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*dʰugh₂tḗr}}.

